# Host pnpm trees are often package-local symlinks. Copying them after
# `pnpm install` in the image collides (`cannot copy to non-directory`).
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm

.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
!**/.env.production.local.example
dist
**/dist
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage
.turbo
.vite
.cursor
*.md
!README.md
backups
**/backups
